msgstr "Použiteľné verzie tlačiva DPPO"

#. module: l10n_sk_dppo
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:l10n_sk_dppo.field_cssk_income_tax_return__l10n_sk_dppo_filing_deadline
msgid "Applicable legal filing deadline"
msgstr "Uplatniteľná zákonná lehota na podanie"

#. module: l10n_sk_dppo
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_sk_dppo/models/cssk_income_tax.py:0
msgid "The 2026 DPPO form is not supported yet"
msgstr "Tlačivo DPPO 2026 zatiaľ nie je podporované"

#. module: l10n_sk_dppo
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_sk_dppo/models/cssk_income_tax.py:0
msgid ""
"The filing deadline of this return ends on %(deadline)s, after 31 December "
"2026. Under oznámenie MF/014310/2026-721 such a return is filed on the new "
"DPPO form MF/014309/2026-721, not on the 2025 form (MF/012187/2025-721). The"
" new form has been published, but the Financial Administration has not yet "
"published its electronic schema (XSD) and this module does not support it "
"yet. The return cannot be created until that version is installed. If this "
"is not the legal deadline of the return, correct the Applicable legal filing"
" deadline."
msgstr ""
"Lehota na podanie tohto priznania uplynie %(deadline)s, teda po 31. decembri"
" 2026. Podľa oznámenia MF/014310/2026-721 sa také priznanie podáva na novom "
"tlačive DPPO MF/014309/2026-721, nie na tlačive z roku 2025 "
"(MF/012187/2025-721). Nové tlačivo bolo zverejnené, finančná správa však "
"zatiaľ nezverejnila jeho elektronickú schému (XSD) a tento modul ho zatiaľ "
"nepodporuje. Priznanie nemožno vytvoriť, kým nebude táto verzia "
"nainštalovaná. Ak to nie je zákonná lehota tohto priznania, opravte pole "
"Uplatniteľná zákonná lehota na podanie."

#. module: l10n_sk_dppo
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_sk_dppo/models/cssk_income_tax.py:0
msgid ""
"The form version %(version)s does not apply to this return. Under oznámenie "
"MF/014310/2026-721 the DPPO form follows the last day of the filing "
"deadline, here %(deadline)s: the 2025 form (MF/012187/2025-721) only when it"
" ends on or before 31 December 2026. Choose a version the return offers for "
"its period and deadline."
msgstr ""
"Verzia tlačiva %(version)s sa na toto priznanie nevzťahuje. Podľa oznámenia "
"MF/014310/2026-721 sa tlačivo DPPO určuje podľa posledného dňa lehoty na "
"podanie, tu %(deadline)s: tlačivo z roku 2025 (MF/012187/2025-721) len "
"vtedy, ak uplynie najneskôr 31. decembra 2026. Zvoľte verziu, ktorú "
"priznanie ponúka pre svoje obdobie a lehotu."

#. module: l10n_sk_dppo
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_sk_dppo.field_cssk_income_tax_return__l10n_sk_dppo_filing_deadline
msgid ""
"The legal deadline including an effective extension, when it differs from "
"the ordinary three-calendar-month deadline. This is not the actual filing "
"date."
msgstr ""
"Zákonná lehota vrátane účinného predĺženia, ak sa líši od riadnej lehoty "
"troch kalendárnych mesiacov. Nie je to skutočný dátum podania."

#. module: l10n_sk_dppo
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:l10n_sk_dppo.field_cssk_income_tax_return__version_id
msgid "Version"
msgstr "Verzia"
